      <p>A technically sound website is the prerequisite for ranking well. We audit and fix site speed issues, crawlability problems, indexation errors, mobile usability gaps, and structured data implementation. Technical SEO removes the barriers that prevent Google from understanding and ranking your content. <a href="/technical-seo-birmingham/">Learn about our technical SEO service</a>.</p>

      <h3>SEO Audits</h3>
      <p>Before we recommend any strategy, we conduct a thorough audit of your current search performance. Our audits cover technical health, on-page optimisation, content quality, backlink profile, competitor analysis, and local search presence. You receive a prioritised action plan with clear recommendations and expected impact. <a href="/seo-audit-birmingham/">Request an SEO audit</a>.</p>

      <h3>AI Search Optimisation</h3>
      <p>The search landscape is shifting. ChatGPT, Perplexity, Google AI Overviews, and Microsoft Copilot are changing how people discover businesses. We optimise your content, structured data, and entity authority to ensure your Birmingham business is cited and recommended by AI search platforms. <a href="/ai-search-optimisation-birmingham/">Explore AI search optimisation</a>.</p>

      <h3>Content Strategy</h3>
      <p>We create content that serves both users and search engines. Every piece of content targets specific keyword clusters, addresses genuine user questions, and builds topical authority in your industry. Content is written in-house, grounded in search data, and optimised for both traditional and AI search.</p>

      <h3>Link Building and Digital PR</h3>
      <p>Backlinks remain a critical ranking factor. We build relevant, authoritative links through digital PR, local partnerships, industry directories, and content-led outreach. Our approach prioritises quality and relevance over volume, focusing on links that move the needle for Birmingham-specific rankings.</p>
    </section>

