      <p>Each area has distinct search patterns and competitive landscapes. A business in Solihull faces different competition to one in Wolverhampton, and the keywords driving traffic differ accordingly. We build area-specific strategies that reflect these differences. <a href="/areas/">View all areas we cover</a>.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
