      <p>Birmingham's manufacturing heritage remains a major economic driver. B2B manufacturers need SEO strategies that target procurement managers and specifiers, not consumers. We build content and technical strategies that generate qualified leads from decision-makers searching for suppliers and partners.</p>

      <h3>Healthcare and Dental</h3>
      <p>Medical and dental practices in Birmingham compete intensely for local patients. We navigate the specific challenges of healthcare SEO, including YMYL (Your Money Your Life) content standards, medical accuracy requirements, and the critical importance of Google Business Profile reviews.</p>

      <h3>Hospitality and Food</h3>
      <p>Birmingham's restaurant scene has grown enormously, with areas like Digbeth, the Jewellery Quarter, and Brindleyplace becoming dining destinations. We help restaurants, hotels, and hospitality businesses capture the high-intent local searches that drive bookings and covers. <a href="/industries/">See all industries</a>.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
