      <p>Find out how your website performs in Birmingham search results. Our free audit covers technical health, local optimisation, content quality, and competitor positioning — with actionable recommendations you can implement immediately.</p>
      <a href="/free-seo-audit-birmingham/">Request Your Free Audit</a>
    </div>

    <section>
      <h2>How Our SEO Process Works</h2>

      <p>We follow a structured, proven process that delivers consistent results for Birmingham businesses. No shortcuts, no guesswork.</p>

      <ol>
        <li><strong>Discovery and Audit</strong> — we analyse your current search performance, technical health, content quality, and competitive landscape. This gives us a clear picture of where you stand and where the opportunities lie.</li>
