        <li><strong>Months 3-4:</strong> Content and optimisation take effect. Rankings improve for target keywords. Local map pack visibility increases.</li>
        <li><strong>Months 5-6:</strong> Organic traffic growth becomes measurable. Lead generation from organic search increases. AI search citations begin appearing.</li>
        <li><strong>Months 6-12:</strong> Compounding returns. Your site builds authority, rankings stabilise at higher positions, and organic becomes a reliable, cost-effective acquisition channel.</li>
      </ul>

      <p>The exact timeline depends on your starting position, industry competitiveness, and the scope of work. We provide realistic projections during the audit phase and update them monthly based on actual performance data.</p>
